1
00:00:03,202 --> 00:00:09,353
The Visitor Identity section decides how anonymous visitors are recognized, for unique visitor

2
00:00:09,353 --> 00:00:11,322
counts and for the limits.

3
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:17,842
A first-party cookie, with its own Visitor cookie name and Cookie lifetime in days, identifies them.

4
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:23,798
Turn on Allow cross-site embedding when the chat is embedded in a frame on another site.

5
00:00:23,798 --> 00:00:28,185
Without it a browser refuses the cookie in a frame, and every request

6
00:00:28,185 --> 00:00:29,999
looks like a new visitor.

7
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:34,210
Partition the cookie per embedding site keeps those cookies apart.

8
00:00:34,692 --> 00:00:39,938
Remote address storage mode is Disabled, Hashed, Plain text or Encrypted.

9
00:00:39,938 --> 00:00:42,727
Hashed is the privacy-first default.

10
00:00:42,727 --> 00:00:46,712
Hashed and Encrypted use the Remote address hash salt.

